{
  "_comment": [
    "HTMLHint rules for the generated in-app Help partials under",
    "src/fim/gui/webui/help/.",
    "",
    "Those files are fragments, not documents: dev/bin/generate-help-html",
    "converts doc/usage.md and doc/configuration.md into body content",
    "that the Help screen injects into an element inside index.html. They",
    "therefore have no doctype, no <html>, and no <title>, and the",
    "document-level rules in .htmlhintrc would report that absence as",
    "three errors that nobody can or should fix.",
    "",
    "Everything that does apply to a fragment stays on -- unbalanced",
    "tags and duplicated ids matter just as much inside a partial. The",
    "tag-pair rule here earned its keep immediately by catching a",
    "misplaced pair of backticks in doc/usage.md that had been emitting",
    "a stray </sub> into the shipped Help text."
  ],
  "tagname-lowercase": true,
  "attr-lowercase": true,
  "attr-value-double-quotes": true,
  "attr-no-duplication": true,
  "attr-unsafe-chars": true,
  "doctype-first": false,
  "doctype-html5": false,
  "title-require": false,
  "tag-pair": true,
  "tag-self-close": false,
  "spec-char-escape": true,
  "id-unique": true,
  "src-not-empty": true,
  "head-script-disabled": false,
  "style-disabled": true,
  "inline-style-disabled": false,
  "inline-script-disabled": false,
  "space-tab-mixed-disabled": "space",
  "id-class-ad-disabled": true,
  "href-abs-or-rel": false,
  "alt-require": true,
  "input-requires-label": false,
  "empty-tag-not-self-closed": false,
  "id-class-value": false
}
